If you're going to wish for artifacts, you're probably better off
going with SDSM and getting a MR artifact, since many of them have MR,
but few items in the game have reflection.  (I learned this the hard
way, level 1 /oW, I neglect reflection, die to a gnome with a wand of
sleep and a bunch of angry dwarves on dlvl 4) To this end, the eye is
always a strong option.  Note that it could have saved you in your
second game by porting to whichever of the mines or dungeon you
weren't currently in, or Sokoban if you'd been there.  Magicbane is
also amazing for fast semi-permanent E-word spam (would have,
incidentally, saved you in the first game)


